{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"176c960ba5d5b81e87e4294677f62e1bdd92cc79bf07ec6109bfcdc86f817fb6","ja":"謎の線の目的","zh":"神秘线条的目的","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"51b7951be6b245812870f0b2005cc2de7313a99c9e7088114987b94d001e3cb6","ja":"まさか、謎の線を描いていた犯人が、\n●●●●プロデューサーさんだったとは～。","zh":"真没想到，画下那些神秘线条的犯人，\n居然是●●●●制作人先生～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"36c606db9454013df1c9547d630cc0bfe4f64df03b6f78f2d06f865d58e46014","ja":"私たちを不安にさせた責任、\n後でしっかりとってもらいましょう～。","zh":"害得我们这么担心的责任，\n待会儿可得好好负起来哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c2843e958cdddc56edabd524d6b068ef7bc39a07e29fba7caa35e2580054b701","ja":"まあまあ、●●●●プロデューサーも\n悪気はなかったんだから。ね、朋花ちゃん？","zh":"好啦好啦，●●●●制作人也\n不是故意的嘛。对吧，朋花？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ef6b38a42250341d29badcfb859eb465a017251e1d0b4e2491a3699f56b64141","ja":"そもそも、あたしが気にしないでいたら、\n大ごとにならなかったのに……。恥ずかしいべさ。","zh":"本来要是我不在意的话，\n就不会闹得这么大了……真是难为情。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8d9a2ecc27ac2240687031bd4c54498fa8480c8af8b6c083c7d23367eab9c1d8","ja":"それを言うなら、私達も宇宙人の話で\n騒ぎを大きくしちゃったわけだし。","zh":"真要那么说的话，我们拿外星人的事\n小题大做也是把事情闹大了呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"788f766aa923e9cd7cfb1a1f2ea16cfdd4ca96a253c9b925ecc150096f2e1db5","ja":"でもあれが、大きな会場を想定して、\n外でレッスンするためのラインだったなんてね。","zh":"不过没想到那居然是为了设想在大场地，\n所以在外面练习而画的线呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b17f6a122cbc6c55b8a6fad77f55ec4ccda12819b1154578ef71ccca45bff585","ja":"それが何度も描きなおして、\n変な模様になっただけなんて。","zh":"那只是因为画错了好多次，\n才变成了奇怪的花纹而已。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1d6c84e75f24cdd9833ea9e78859666cf5a7c9f353dddcce6597eae9a3a38618","ja":"ひなたちゃんが聞いた不思議な音も、\n故障したラジカセから流れていたのだとか～。","zh":"小日向听到的不可思议的声音，\n也是坏掉的收录机里播出来的呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"90c076a1029c7a4fa109ae37a86c79cb6b274bf7332df8481306c6c0970923d8","ja":"うん、●●●●プロデューサーの話を聞いて、\nほっとしたよぉ。","zh":"嗯，听了●●●●制作人的话，\n我就放心啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d3df1951ee35badaf5bdab3722cb48eb0db5a7cf05236af15e421d7b7faef3a2","ja":"ええ、線を描いた目的が分かってよかったわ。\nけど……。","zh":"嗯，能明白画这条线的目的真是太好了。\n但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"38e77c63517b77ca7ec916427192be1464e8abbae165f5f4501eed9fc77576ad","ja":"理由が分かった今でも、\nとても不気味に見えるわね……。","zh":"就算知道了原因，\n现在看起来也还是很诡异呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f0b71c96cb6344b679bc6770ba2487ee7b8e15ef114fad8f6654f7f123ec46ef","ja":"姫もそう思うのです。これなら\n本当に宇宙人が訪ねてきそうなのですよ。","zh":"公主也这么觉得呢。这样一来\n真的会有宇宙人来访也说不定哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1229.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"f9c85c5bb07de88ebb36bc6ea99e77c9720517fcd3e8ec8428ceccffd095607c","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんがちゃんとした\nラインを引けるように、これから特訓なのです！","zh":"●●●●为了让制作人先生能画出\n像样的线，接下来要进行特训了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
